   <indicator measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Status of Implementation Progress: 1a. Construction of two 400/220/132 kV Grid Substation (GSS) at Bhadla and Ramgarh completed. 1b. Augmentation of two 400 kV GSS at Akal and Bikaner completed. 1c. Construction of about 602 km of 400 kV, 220 kV, 132 kV transmission lines completed. 1d. Construction of two 220/132 kV GSS at Bap and Kanasar completed from RRVPNL own funding. 1e. Augmentation of PS 2,3,4 to 132 kV GSS completed from RRVPNL own funding. 2. Development of institutional capacity for renewable energy parks and transmission system had been completed under TA 8486-IND: Rajasthan Renewable Energy Capacity Development and Implementation Support.</narrative>
    </title>
